---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
		<style>
		ul {
			font-size: 1.1em;
			line-height: 1.75em;
			margin: 5px 0 15px;
		}
		li {
			list-style: none;
			position: relative;
			padding: 0 0 0 20px;
		}
		li::before {
			content: "";
			position: absolute;
			left: 0;
			top: 14px;
			height: 5px;
			width: 5px;
			border: 1px solid #000;
			border-width: 2px 2px 0 0;
			transform: rotate(45deg);
		}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Hello, weary traveller...</h1>
			<p>
				Welcome to my blog. This is me yapping about whatever fancies me. 
				It will be a bit random but I do hope you will find some entertainment.
			</p>

			<p>
				Professionaly I've been a software developer for over 10 years so I assume i will mostly speak about that. 
				I value work-life balance greatly which means I am enthusiastic about more than just tech. 
				For example I've gotten into chess during the pandemic and still find it to be a exciting past-time.			
			</p>

			<p>
				Furthermore I hope to build a small portfolio of projects to be proud of so keep an eye on my github. 
				I would appreciate it if you follow me on X. If you are interested in playing chess vs me befriend me on lichess.
			</p>

			<p>
				English is not my native language so forgive any spelling mistakes.
			</p>
				
			<p> Here some general advice for people strapped for time:
				<ul>
					<li>Strive for greatness.</li>
					<li>Be kind, to others and to yourself.</li>
					<li>Take action, to change the world into one you want to live in.</li>
				</ul>
			</p>			
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
